set cT[i]="Get Soul Steal if you need healing in the lane."
set CT[i]="Purchase statistic-increasing items like Wraith Bands and later items like Sange and Yasha to benefit both Terrorblade and his images."
set DT[i]="It might be difficult to escape due to the trail you leave behind when walking, you may have to use an image to act as a block or decoy."
set fT[i]="Sunder can turn fights around when you have low health but be careful of disables and high damage spells when trying to swap."
set FT[i]="Creating ranged images in Metamorphosis will allow you to deal damage safely in fights as well as push down buildings very quickly."
set i=i+1
