set cT[i]="With plenty of damage and disables, Lion is quite a force to be reckoned with cheap utility items such as Bottle and Phase Boots."
set CT[i]="Impale gives Lion the ability to disable multiple targets and deals decent damage, so it is definitely the most versatile of his three skills for the early game."
set DT[i]="Mana Drain only works on units with mana: Using Mana Drain on enemy heroes will reduce their spell use while replenishing mana."
set fT[i]="Avoid wasting Finger of Death on low-health enemy heroes when a few extra attacks or using another spell like Impale will deal enough damage."
set FT[i]="Wait until the duration of your first disable wears off before using another one for maximum disable time when using Impale and Voodoo."
set i=i+1
