set cT[i]="Venomous Gale is a spell that hits multiple opponents and slows them, making it very useful for getting early kills."
set CT[i]="At least one level of Poison Sting is recommended early game for its slow effect."
set DT[i]="Bottle and Magic Stick will help deal with his low HP/mana, while Phase Boots are a cheap way to improve his chasing capabilities."
set fT[i]="Wards are very useful for pushing a lane and killing neutral and enemy creeps, but you can also use it to provide vision."
set FT[i]="Poison Nova deals a lot of damage but you have to combine it with other spells and attacks because it does not deal fatal damage (stops at 1 HP)."
set i=i+1
