set cT[i]="Chaos Bolt and Blink Strike are active abilities that are more useful in the lane and for killing opponents than Critical Strike."
set CT[i]="Chaos Bolt is a disable that switches between average and extremely powerful, the sooner you have max out this spell, the better."
set DT[i]="His high natural movement speed (325 - the highest in the game) and Blink Strike make him very difficult for opponents to outrun or chase him."
set fT[i]="If you Blink Strike and then use Chaos Bolt, you can spend more time hitting opponents and less time waiting for his slow casting animation. "
set FT[i]="Make Nessaj and Phantasm stronger by buying Strength items like Armlet of Mordiggan (when activated) and Heart of Tarrasque."
set i=i+1
