set cT[i]="If you want to neutral creeps, start with Summon Wolves and a Ring of Basilius, which can be used to make Vladmir's Offering later."
set CT[i]="Spirit Wolves gain invisibility at level 4, making them difficult to kill and easy to harass heroes with in the lane."
set DT[i]="Feral Heart make you and your wolves stronger overall, while Howl is an offensive spell used before engaging the enemy."
set fT[i]="Shapeshift makes you incredibly powerful and gives you max movement speed. Avoid being blocked by your wolves when chasing."
set FT[i]="A Black King Bar will prevent enemies from disabling you, making you very fearsome and almost unstoppable when attacking heroes."
set i=i+1
